Package: LFPM
Type: Package
Title: Adaptive L-Statistic Tests for Linear Factor Pricing Models
Version: 0.1.1
Author: Chenxi Zhao
Maintainer: Chenxi Zhao <chxzhao@mail.nankai.edu.cn>
Description: Implements ordered-sum and adaptive tests of intercepts in
    high-dimensional linear factor pricing models, with reusable R functions
    and reproducible simulation workflows for "Testing factor pricing
    restrictions in high dimensions without knowing the sparsity of alphas".
    Provides explicit bootstrap-tail and bootstrap-moment
    component calibration options. Case-study material is limited to external
    data-source links; case-study analysis code and market data are not included.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: stats, utils, graphics, grDevices, parallel
NeedsCompilation: no
